    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "I mean, when I looked at this report, even I was surprised. I mean, I do have an office in downtown Denver and I was looking through this comprehensive report and it shows that we are not a safe state. We are not a state that's getting safer and it's something that every Colorado ought to be concerned about.",
