    "turn_idx": 14,
    "turn_text": "At Advanced Colorado, we've launched into a agenda we call moving Colorado forward for 2024. The legislature is coming back into session. One of the issues, which I know is important to you, is truth and sentencing, where you got to serve the time that your victims and the community think you're going to serve. Talk about that and",
