  {
    "episode_id": 81549,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/1/81549.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "Another issue that we've embraced is the ending of personal reconnaissance bonds. And I'm sure your prosecutors would see a person come in the door and the judge would say, well, I'm going to trust you to come back. You do good out there, buddy. We've proposed to get rid of them. What's your thought on that?",
