    "turn_text": "What's your message as we wrap up, what's your message to folks who are watching and listening who may not consider themselves super conservative, they may not, you know, they may not think that they want to register Republican and yet Crime, to me, isn't an ideological issue. What should they be watching for at the legislature this year? What are some of the hot button issues or signals that they're getting that maybe this group at the legislature isn't doing them a favor, even if they may have voted for them? What are they going to hear? What should they do about it?",
